# Modifiers API – REST Client
#
# Endpoints: /modifiers
# Purpose:
# - Individual modifier options within a modifier group.
# - Each modifier has a base price and can have dependencies that override
#   its price or availability based on other modifier selections.
# - Example: "Large" modifier in a "Size" group with basePrice 350 (€3.50).
#
# Auth / cookies:
# - If your API uses Better Auth cookie sessions, keep @cookieJar consistent across files.
# - Origin protection: include Origin + Referer headers on protected routes.
#
# Usage flow:
# 1) Run Auth login in auth.http (stores cookie in jar)
# 2) Create a product (products.http)
# 3) Create a modifier group (modifier-groups.http)
# 4) Run requests here (cookie is reused via the same jar name)
#
# Notes:
# - Replace {{modifierId}}, {{modifierGroupId}} with UUIDs from responses.
# - Prices are in cents (e.g., 350 = €3.50 or $3.50)
# - If your API is mounted under /api, set @apiPrefix = /api

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@cookieJar = betterauth

# If your server mounts routes under /api, set this to /api. Otherwise leave empty.
@apiPrefix = /api

# IDs (paste values from responses)
@modifierGroupId = 2d89b9a9-7b56-4b0a-a0f9-08a842cd0146
@modifierId = e19e06d3-3492-4e91-8d2b-73efa0b9d2ec


### List modifiers for a group - ok
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/modifiers/by-group/{{modifierGroupId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

### Retrieve a modifier by id - ok
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/modifiers/{{modifierId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

//TODO:
### ??? Retrieve a modifier with its dependencies
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/modifiers/{{modifierId}}/dependencies
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

### Create Size modifiers - ok
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/modifiers
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "modifierGroupId": "bcf255e9-f617-4d74-b1e3-7e33e15e1336",
  "name": "Small",
  "description": "12 oz",
  "basePrice": 0,
  "isDefault": true,
  "isActive": true,
  "displayOrder": 0
}

# {
#   "modifierGroupId": "bcf255e9-f617-4d74-b1e3-7e33e15e1336",
#   "name": "Medium",
#   "description": "16 oz",
#   "basePrice": 50,
#   "isDefault": false,
#   "isActive": true,
#   "displayOrder": 1
# }

# {
