### Update a modifier (only include fields you want to change) - ok
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/modifiers/{{modifierId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "basePrice": 120,
  "description": "Extra large"
}

### Mark modifier as out of stock - ok
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/modifiers/{{modifierId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Delete a modifier - ok
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/modifiers/{{modifierId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/
